V9QNTkwVlJIYnM?oc=5", "source": "NBC News", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": 0.028, "via": "aluminium"}, {"id": "2cb9f5078b72", "ts": "2026-10-17T00:37:00Z", "title": "Trump waives some Russia sanctions, restrictions and energy-linked duties under the Graham Act", "summary": "Trump signed an executive order waiving application of certain sanctions, restrictions and duties under the Sanctioning Russia and Iran Act (signed Sept 18, initial measures due Oct 18) and certified to Congress that the waivers serve US national interests; Bloomberg says the waivers cover Russia energy tariffs.", "url": "https://www.financialjuice.com/News/9809589/Trump-waives-application-of-certain-sanctions-restrictions-and-duties-in-executive-order.aspx?xy=rss", "source": "FinancialJuice / Bloomberg", "scale": "notable", "category": "sanctions", "region": "US / Russia", "c": -0.028, "via": "aluminium"}, {"id": "0c2ba442ab2f", "ts": "2026-10-17T06:28:00Z", "title": "UKMTO: tanker hit by unidentified projectile northeast of Saudi Arabia's Jubail", "summary": "UKMTO reported a tanker was struck by an unidentified projectile northeast of Jubail on Friday; the crew was safe and evacuated. It extends Gulf shipping attacks beyond the Strait of Hormuz into Saudi waters.", "url": "https://www.financialjuice.com/News/9809790/UKMTO-Tanker-hit-by-unidentified-projectile-northeast-of-Saudi-Arabias-Jubail-on-Friday-crew-safe-and-evacuated.aspx?xy=rss", "source": "FinancialJuice", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": 0.027, "via": "aluminium"}, {"id": "892e48d4ee25", "ts": "2026-10-17T01:39:00Z", "title": "IRGC says a supertanker caught fire after hitting a naval mine on an 'unauthorized' Hormuz route", "summary": "Iran's Revolutionary Guards said an oil tanker ignited after striking a naval mine while using what they called an unauthorized route through the Strait of Hormuz; the vessel was not identified and the claim was not independently verified. It follows similar IRGC claims on Oct 10 (supertanker) and Oct 14 (container ship).", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/10/17/draft-2", "source": "Al Jazeera / FinancialJuice", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": 0.026, "via": "aluminium"}, {"id": "cea346a0c667", "ts": "2026-10-18T11:20:00Z", "title": "Ukraine launches more than 1,000 drones at Russia, setting St Petersburg oil terminal and depot ablaze", "summary": "Russia's defence ministry said it downed about 1,015 Ukrainian drones overnight, one of the largest attacks of the war; fires hit the St Petersburg oil terminal, the Ruchyi oil depot and a VK data centre, with one person killed. Russia answered with about 300 drones.", "url": "https://abcnews.com/International/ukraine-targets-russia-1000-drones-striking-oil-terminal/story?id=137358203", "source": "ABC News", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Russia", "c": 0.025, "via": "aluminium"}, {"id": "abe9106c05b2", "ts": "2026-10-16T18:09:42Z", "title": "Indian official says crude tanker targeted by missile in Strait of Hormuz", "summary": "An Indian shipping official said a crude oil tanker was targeted by a missile in the Strait of Hormuz on Friday and also referred to the recent Romania-linked tanker incident; it adds to this week's string of attacks on Gulf shipping.", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "source": "Newsquawk", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": 0.024, "via": "aluminium"}, {"id": "add7f19ca7e3", "ts": "2026-10-15T04:57:00Z", "title": "Copper falls for a third day as hot US CPI hits metals; ICSG sees refined surplus widening in 2027", "summary": "Copper fell for a third straight session after strong US inflation data lifted rate-hike bets, and the ICSG, meeting in Lisbon this week, said it expects the global refined copper surplus to widen in 2027.", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOQ0psUFhiRzE0dTRhNF9VT09tUG9BWmw2QUxYOWE1Qy1aUURTTVBrRHpHVFAzRDNyLVdqV0ZfaUEzdXRYMDBGWnNHTzlkVzhJYUw3NWJTcHY3dUl5MDRlcGNNSVRDQnZFZ1N3QUJnRFhqUTAyei1aRzBxU3dIZm1QbFRWVjFoMDFsSVBQa01DR1JadUxXUk9XZzFqbTNwSXRIRExpeTk0R0hVUzVCckF3U1UzcWQ?oc=5", "source": "Bloomberg.com", "scale": "notable", "category": "metals", "region": "Global", "c": -0.023, "via": "copper"}, {"id": "c0d6d197835e", "ts": "2026-10-14T06:00:00Z", "title": "Iran deploys new tactics against ships; two vessels struck in Strait of Hormuz", "summary": "Brent rose to about $106.32 early on 14 Oct after two vessels were hit. Kpler: only 2.9m barrels moved through Hormuz on 11 Oct vs 17.1m b/d pre-war.", "url": "https://euronews.com/2026/10/14/oil-prices-rise-after-reported-attacks-on-ships-in-strait-of-hormuz", "source": "Euronews", "scale": "major", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": 0.023, "via": "aluminium"}, {"id": "87773fbc1923", "ts": "2026-10-17T03:03:00Z", "title": "Striking unions at Antofagasta's Centinela copper mine reach preliminary deal, ending strike", "summary": "Two unions at Antofagasta Minerals' Centinela mine in Chile reached a preliminary agreement that ends the strike begun on Oct 7 after mediated talks failed; unions had warned the walkout could halve November output.", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "source": "Reuters via Investing.com", "scale": "minor", "category": "metals", "region": "Chile", "c": -0.018, "via": "copper"}, {"id": "bd4998ac79c7", "ts": "2026-10-15T01:00:00Z", "title": "Dollar retreats from 18-month high as Fed's Bowman and Daly temper hike bets", "summary": "The dollar index slipped to about 102.06 after the hot CPI pushed it to an 18-month high; Bowman and Daly said the Fed can wait for a clearer picture before the Oct 27-28 meeting, and the 10-year yield fell to a three-week low near 5.13%.", "url": "https://www.tradingview.com/news/reuters.com,2026:newsml_L4N46104B:0-dollar-retreats-from-18-month-high-despite-hot-cpi-as-fed-officials-temp